5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must ensure the human element is secure. I shall look into staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the money actually goes! I'll check travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should see what actually worked before. I will look at closeout files of finished awards and portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't ignore the crashes and delays. I'm checking incident logs on shared instrumentation and station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Infrastructure is the backbone. I will examine the national computing agreement and facility day rates, plus accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, your curiosity is a gift. It is wise to see if the budget matches the reality of the lab.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Thanks, Servas! @Takumi, do you think the field sites are the biggest risk?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope we don't pick something that looks good but fails.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Field sites are a gamble, Sakura. I want to know if we're walking into a disaster.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"We must be objective. If the facilities are full, the best science in the world won't happen.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,Indeed. A project is only as strong as the hands that guide it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm excited to see if there are any secrets in those ledgers!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not taking any chances with ""unforeseen"" delays this time.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,Agreed. Let us gather the facts before we see the candidates.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
