35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a shortage of phenotyping technicians, but plenty of interest in modelling and code. However, senior analysts are seconded abroad.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The glasshouses are totally booked up! But the ministry is still helping with those bench fees, which is a relief.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Catalogue-style projects have lasted much longer. Mechanism-focused ones often end without answering their main questions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"It's a mess. Field sites are getting hit by fire and floods, and the spectroscopy suite was down for eleven weeks!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Computing is free under the new agreement, but animal facility rates have spiked. The animal facility is accredited, though.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if computing is free and analysts are available, perhaps a digital approach is safest.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, if the spectroscopy suite is broken, we should avoid anything relying on it!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,And we should avoid high-risk biological mechanisms if they tend to stall.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,Exactly. And forget the field sites; they're basically underwater or on fire.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,The glasshouse bottleneck Sakura mentioned is a major problem for any plant research.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"We must be careful. Even with code, we lack the senior analysts until next autumn.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"So no plants because of the bookings, and no fancy spectroscopy because it's broken?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,It sounds like a large-scale data project might be the most stable choice.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I agree. I'm tired of seeing projects fail because a machine broke or a forest burned.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The animal facility is ready, but the cost is high. We must weigh that against the free computing.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see the candidates and apply these hard truths.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm ready! Let's find something that actually fits the budget and the space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll look for the ""catalogue"" style that lasts.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,As long as it doesn't require a miracle to finish on time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,We will prioritize viability over ambition.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
